Z||000028||Raydar||05-05-2001||11:39 PM||||'Fraid I don't know the owner of the lime green GT, either. Missed the last meeting do to an advanced case of the creepin' crud. Talked to Don (one of the other guys in the club) today. He was raving about that green paint, too. I thought it looked good too, but talk about a ticket magnet!<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 black Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
